        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Waaqi waan jed'e, Koota, nama mid'aasina fakeennafi akheekha keenna gula, aka inni qurt'umi baariinitifi waan gubbaa barisa ch'ufafi horifi bineensa allaatiifi waan garaani lafa ira lohu ch'ufale mohatu. ",
