          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqi wonti inni mid'aase ch'ufti guddo dansa arge. Galgali tahe diiramileeni tahe; kunini guyya jaeeso.",
          "type": "text",
